{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"94112","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/94112","key":"MC-258360","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"07/Dec/22 5:34 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"TheBug%3A\"></a><b>The Bug:</b></h3>\n\n<p>Horse armor loses its NBT data when equipped on horses via right-clicking.</p>\n\n<p>It's important to note that this issue does not occur when equipping the horse armor through the horses' inventory. This problem is most noticeable with dyed leather horse armor; when right-clicking a horse with dyed horse armor, the horse armor loses its color.</p>\n<h3><a name=\"StepstoReproduce%3A\"></a><b>Steps to Reproduce:</b></h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Summon a tamed horse by using the command provided below.\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">/summon minecraft:horse ~ ~ ~ {NoAI:1b,Tame:1b}</pre>\n</div></div></li>\n\t<li>Give yourself some leather horse armor that contains custom NBT data by using the command provided below.\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">/give @s minecraft:leather_horse_armor{display:{Name:<span class=\"code-quote\">'{<span class=\"code-quote\">\"text\"</span>:<span class=\"code-quote\">\"MC-258360\"</span>,<span class=\"code-quote\">\"italic\"</span>:<span class=\"code-quote\">\"<span class=\"code-keyword\">false</span>\"</span>}'</span>,color:11141290}}</pre>\n</div></div></li>\n\t<li>Right-click on the horse while holding the horse armor to equip the horse with the horse armor.</li>\n\t<li>Take note as to whether or not horse armor loses its NBT data when equipped on horses via right-clicking.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"ObservedBehavior%3A\"></a><b>Observed Behavior:</b></h3>\n\n<p>NBT data of the horse armor is lost.</p>\n<h3><a name=\"ExpectedBehavior%3A\"></a><b>Expected Behavior:</b></h3>\n\n<p>NBT data of horse armor would not be lost.</p>\n<h3><a name=\"Video%3A\"></a><b>Video:</b></h3>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2htKzz-VOXc\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2htKzz-VOXc</a></p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"08/Dec/22 10:30 AM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/122941","id":"122941","filename":"1.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png"},"displayName":"migrated","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"07/Dec/22 10:03 PM","size":"2.72 MB","mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/122941","thumbnail":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/122941"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/122942","id":"122942","filename":"2.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b